irim?",body:"\xc7ok kolay! Sadece uygulamay\u0131 kullanarak puan kazan\u0131n."},noActivities:{title:"Daha Fazla Puan\u0131n Kilidini A\xe7mak i\xe7in G\xfcncelleyin \ud83d\udd13",body:"Oops! G\xf6r\xfcn\xfc\u015fe g\xf6re {{appName}} uygulamas\u0131n\u0131n eski bir s\xfcr\xfcm\xfcn\xfc kullan\u0131yorsunuz. Puan kazanabilece\u011finiz t\xfcm heyecan verici yeni yollar\u0131 ke\u015ffetmek i\xe7in \u015fimdi g\xfcncelleyin."},activityCards:{createWallet:{title:"Bir {{appName}} C\xfczdan\u0131 Olu\u015fturun"},swap:{title:"Varl\u0131klar\u0131 takas edin",bottomSheet:{title:"Varl\u0131klar\u0131 takas edin",body:"{{appName}} uygulamas\u0131n\u0131 kullanarak her varl\u0131k takas\u0131 yapt\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131zda {{pointsValue}} puan\u0131 kazan\u0131n. \n\nTakas etmeye ve kazanmaya ba\u015flamak i\xe7in a\u015fa\u011f\u0131ya dokunun!",cta:"Bir takas ba\u015flat\u0131n"}},moreComing:{title:"Daha fazlas\u0131 yak\u0131nda!"},createLiveLink:{title:"Canl\u0131 Ba\u011flant\u0131 ile G\xf6nder",bottomSheet:{title:"Canl\u0131 Ba\u011flant\u0131 ile G\xf6nder",body:"{{appName}} uygulamas\u0131yla bir Canl\u0131 Ba\u011flant\u0131 kullanarak her fon g\xf6nderdi\u011finizde {{pointsValue}} puan kazan\u0131n. \n\nG\xf6ndermeye ve kazanmaya ba\u015flamak i\xe7in a\u015fa\u011f\u0131ya dokunun!",cta:"Canl\u0131 Ba\u011flant\u0131 ile G\xf6nder"}},depositEarn:{title:"{{appName}} uygulamas\u0131ndaki kazan\xe7 havuzuna para yat\u0131r\u0131n",bottomSheet:{title:"Bir kazan\xe7 havuzuna para yat\u0131rma",body:"{{appName}} uygulamas\u0131ndaki bir kazan\xe7 havuzuna her fon yat\u0131rd\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131zda {{pointsValue}} puan kazan\u0131n. \n\nGetiri ve puan kazanmaya ba\u015flamak i\xe7in a\u015fa\u011f\u0131ya dokunun!",cta:"Kazan\xe7 havuzlar\u0131na gidin"}}},discoverCard:{title:"{{appName}} Puanlar\u0131",description:"{{appName}} ile kolayca puan kazan\u0131n. Takas i\u015flemi dahil olmak \xfczere uygulamay\u0131 kullanmak puan kazand\u0131r\u0131r!",balance:"{{pointsBalance}} puanlar\u0131"},intro:{title:"Zahmetsizce puan kazan\u0131n",description:"Kazanmak i\xe7in yeni bir yola girin! {{appName}} eylemleriniz art\u0131k puan kazand\u0131r\u0131yor. Bug\xfcn kazanmaya ba\u015flay\u0131n ve harika avantajlar\u0131n kilidini a\xe7\u0131n.",cta:"Puan yolculu\u011funuza ba\u015flay\u0131n"},disclaimer:{learnMoreCta:"{{appName}} Puanlar\u0131 hakk\u0131nda <0>daha fazla bilgi edinin</0>",title:"{{appName}} Puanlar\u0131 hakk\u0131nda daha fazla bilgi",body:"Puanlar {{appName}} uygulamas\u0131n\u0131n sadakat program\u0131d\u0131r. Uygulamay\u0131 kulland\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131z i\xe7in \xf6d\xfcllendirilirsiniz. Puanlar harcanamaz, takas edilemez veya transfer edilemez.",dismiss:"Anlad\u0131m"}},earnFlow:{gasSubsidized:"\u0130\u015flem \xfccretleri s\u0131n\u0131rl\u0131 bir s\xfcre i\xe7in kar\u015f\u0131lanmaktad\u0131r",addCryptoBottomSheet:{title:"{{tokenNetwork}} a\u011f\u0131na {{tokenSymbol}} ekleyin",description:"Token ekledikten sonra havuza para yat\u0131rma i\u015flemini tamamlamak i\xe7in geri gelmeniz gerekecektir.",actions:{add:"Sat\u0131n Al",transfer:"Transfer Et",swap:"Swap"},actionDescriptions:{add:"G\xfcvenilir sa\u011flay\u0131c\u0131lar\u0131m\u0131zdan birini kullanarak {{tokenNetwork}} a\u011f\u0131nda {{tokenSymbol}} sat\u0131n al\u0131n",transfer:"{{tokenSymbol}} yat\u0131rmak i\xe7in {{tokenNetwork}} uyumlu c\xfczdan veya borsa kullan\u0131n",swap:"Ba\u015fka bir {{tokenNetwork}} tokeninden {{tokenSymbol}} tokenine takas yap\u0131n"}},cta:{title:"Kripto paran\u0131zdan kazan\xe7 sa\u011flay\u0131n",subtitle:"Bug\xfcn para yat\u0131r\u0131n ve getiri kazan\u0131n",description:"Bir kredi havuzu sa\u011flarken ne kadar kazanabilece\u011finizi g\xf6r\xfcn"},earnInfo:{title:"Kripto paran\u0131zdan\nkazan\xe7 sa\u011flay\u0131n",details:{earn:{titleGasSubsidy:"Gas \xdccretleri Olmadan Kazanc\u0131n\u0131z\u0131 En \xdcst D\xfczeye \xc7\u0131kar\u0131n*",title:"Havuzlar\u0131 Ke\u015ffedin ve Kar\u015f\u