lemez",exit:"\xc7\u0131k\u0131\u015f",exitDescription:"\xc7\u0131k\u0131\u015f yap\u0131ld\u0131\u011f\u0131nda, havuzda sahip oldu\u011funuz t\xfcm \xf6\u011feler \xe7ekilir",exitWithRewardsDescription:"\xc7\u0131k\u0131\u015f yap\u0131ld\u0131\u011f\u0131nda, havuzda sahip oldu\u011funuz, \xf6d\xfclleri de i\xe7eren t\xfcm \xf6\u011feler \xe7ekilir",exitWithEarningsDescription:"\xc7\u0131k\u0131\u015f yap\u0131ld\u0131\u011f\u0131nda, havuzda sahip oldu\u011funuz, kazan\xe7lar\u0131 da i\xe7eren t\xfcm \xf6\u011feler \xe7ekilir"},totalDepositAndEarnings:"Toplam Yat\u0131r\u0131m ve Kazan\xe7lar",titleLocalAmountDisplay:"{{localCurrencySymbol}}{{localCurrencyAmount}}",lineItemAmountDisplay:"{{localCurrencySymbol}}{{localCurrencyAmount}} ({{cryptoAmount}} {{cryptoSymbol}})",infoBottomSheet:{gotIt:"Anlad\u0131m",depositDescription:"Bu, yat\u0131rd\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131z tutar\u0131n, bu tutar \xfczerinden kazand\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131z faizin ve havuza kat\u0131larak ald\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131z ek \xf6d\xfcllerin d\xf6k\xfcm\xfcd\xfcr.",depositNoBreakdownDescription:"Bu say\u0131, size verilen tokenlar\u0131 kazand\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131z faiz ve \xf6d\xfcllerle birle\u015ftirir.\n\nBaz\u0131 protokoller, \xf6rne\u011fin {{providerName}}, kazan\xe7lar\u0131n\u0131z\u0131n bir d\xf6k\xfcm\xfcn\xfc sunmaz; bu normaldir. Bunun yerine, kazanc\u0131n\u0131z\u0131 do\u011frudan yat\u0131rd\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131z tutara eklerler ve bu da artan tutara ba\u011fl\u0131 olarak faiz kazanmaya devam eder. ",tvlTitle:"Kilitlenen Toplam De\u011fer (TVL)",tvlDescription:"TVL, bir likidite havuzuna yat\u0131r\u0131lan toplam varl\u0131k miktar\u0131n\u0131 ifade eder ve havuzun g\xfcvenilirli\u011fini ve faydas\u0131n\u0131 g\xf6sterir. Genel olarak TVL de\u011ferinin y\xfcksek olmas\u0131 daha riskin daha d\xfc\u015f\xfck oldu\u011funu g\xf6sterir. Ancak, hi\xe7bir havuz tamamen risksiz de\u011fildir.",ageTitle:"Havuz Ya\u015f\u0131",ageDescription:"Likidite havuzunun eski olmas\u0131, o havuzun sa\u011flam bir ge\xe7mi\u015f performans\u0131 oldu\u011funa ve toplulukta g\xfcven in\u015fa etti\u011fine i\u015faret edebilir. Bu nedenle, baz\u0131lar\u0131 bu havuzlar\u0131n daha g\xfcvenli oldu\u011funu d\xfc\u015f\xfcnebilir.\n\nRiski tam olarak belirleyebilecek bir y\xf6ntem yoktur; bu nedenle genel ara\u015ft\u0131rman\u0131z\u0131 desteklemek i\xe7in bu bilgilerden yararlanabilirsiniz.",yieldRateTitle:"Getiri Oran\u0131",yieldRateDescription:"\xc7o\u011fu havuz, kazan\xe7lar\u0131 likidite havuzunun tokeni \u015feklinde sa\u011flarken baz\u0131 havuzlar, \xf6d\xfcl veya ek te\u015fvik olarak ek tokenler verebilir.\n\n{{appName}} \xe7e\u015fitli protokoller genelindeki havuzlar\u0131 bir araya toplar. Bu nedenle, kazan\xe7 potansiyelinizi kolayca de\u011ferlendirebilmeniz i\xe7in t\xfcm kazan\xe7 ve \xf6d\xfcl oranlar\u0131n\u0131 tek bir genel getiri oran\u0131 alt\u0131nda birle\u015ftirdik. Kazan\xe7 ve \xf6d\xfcl de\u011ferleri s\xfcrekli dalgaland\u0131\u011f\u0131 i\xe7in bu rakam, tahmini bir de\u011feri g\xf6sterir.\n\nKazan\xe7 d\xf6k\xfcmleri hakk\u0131nda daha fazla bilgi i\xe7in <0>{{providerName}}</0> sayfas\u0131n\u0131 ziyaret edebilirsiniz.",dailyYieldRateTitle:"G\xfcnl\xfck Oran",dailyYieldRateDescription:"G\xf6r\xfcnt\xfclenen g\xfcnl\xfck oran, {{providerName}} taraf\u0131ndan sa\u011flanan g\xfcnl\xfck oran\u0131 yans\u0131t\u0131r.",dailyYieldRateLink:"{{providerName}} \xdczerinde Daha Fazla G\xfcnl\xfck Oran G\xf6r\xfcnt\xfcleyin",safetyScoreTitle:"G\xfcvenlik Puan\u0131",safetyScoreDescription:"G\xfcvenlik Puan\u0131, dayanak kasa varl\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131n g\xfcvenli\u011fini birka\xe7 temel fakt\xf6re ay\u0131r\u0131r. Yat\u0131r\u0131m yapmadan \xf6nce g\xf6z \xf6n\xfcnde bulundurman\u0131z gereken risklere dikkatinizi \xe7ekmeyi ve kendi ba\u015f\u0131n\u0131za de\u011ferlendiremeyebilece\u011finiz teknik ayr\u0131nt\u0131lar hakk\u0131nda sizi bilgilendirmeyi ama\xe7lamaktad\u0131r.\nTam pozisyon her zaman daha karma\u015f\u0131k olsa da, G\xfcvenlik Puan\u0131, temel risk ve g\xfcvenlik hususlar\u0131n\u0131 basitle\u015ftirmek ve kendi durum tespitinizi ba\u015flatmak i\xe7in sa\u011flan\u0131r. Ekibimiz, bir kasa devreye al\u0131nmadan \xf6nce her bir fakt\xf6r\xfc dikkatlice de\u011ferlendirir ve {{providerName}} taraf\u0131ndan entegre edilen her bir varl\u0131\u011f\u0131, zinciri ve protokol\xfc dikkatli bi\xe7imde izler.",safetyScoreRateLink:"{{providerName}} \xdczerinde Daha Fazla G\xfcvenlik Puan\u0131 Ayr\u0131nt\u0131s\u0131 g\xf6r\xfcnt\xfcleyin"},viewMoreDetails:"Daha Fazla Ayr\u0131nt\u0131 G\xf6r\xfcnt\xfcle",viewLessDetails:"Daha Az Ayr\u0131nt\u0131 G\xf6r\xfcnt\xfcle"},beforeDepositBottomSheet:{youNeedTitle:"Yat\u0131rma \u0130\u015flemi i\xe7in {{tokenNetwork}} a\u011f\u0131nda {{tokenSymbol}} tokenine sahip olmal\u0131s\u0131n\u0131z",crossChainAlternativeDescription:"{{tokenNetwork}} a\u011f\u0131ndaki tokenlerinizi kullanmaz istemiyorsan\u0131z a\u015fa\u011f\u0131daki se\xe7eneklerden birini se\xe7in. Havuza yat\u0131rma i\u015fleminizi tamamlamak i\xe7in daha sonra geri d\xf6nmeniz gerekecektir.",beforeYouCanDepositTitle:"Para yat\u0131rmadan \xf6nce...",beforeYouCanDepositDescription:"Havuz tokenlerinden birini eklemeniz gereklidir. Token eklendikten sonra havuza para yat\u0131rma i\u015flemini tamamlamak i\xe7in geri d\xf6nmeniz gerekir.",action:{swapAndDeposit:"Swap ve Para Yat\u0131rma",swapAndDepositDescription:"{{tokenNetwork}} a\u011f\u0131ndaki herhangi bir tokeni se\xe7in. Se\xe7ti\u011finiz tokeni sizin i\xe7in an\u0131nda swap edip yat\u0131rma i\u015fleminizi tamamlayaca\u011f\u0131z.",crossChainSwap:"Zincirler aras\u0131 Swap",crossChainSwapDescription:"Ba\u015fka bir a\u011fdaki tokeni {{tokenSymbol}} ile swap edin",swap:"Swap",swapDescription:"C\xfczdan\u0131n\u0131zdaki ba\u015fka bir tokeni {{tokenNetwork}} a\u011f\u0131nda {{tokenSymbol}} ile swap edin",add:"Sat\u0131n Al",addDescription:"G\xfcvenilir sa\u011flay\u0131c\u0131lar\u0131m\u0131zdan birini kullanarak {{tokenNetwork}} a\u011f\u0131nda {{tokenSymbol}} sat\u0131n al\u0131n",transfer:"Transfer Et",transferDescription:"{{tokenSymbol}} yat\u0131rmak i\xe7in {{tokenNetwork}} uyumlu c\xfczdan veya borsa kullan\u0131n"}}},addFundsActions:{add:"Sat\u0131n Al",transfer:"Transfer Et",swap:"Swap"},duration_lessThanADay:"Bir g\xfcnden az",duration_day_one:"1 g\xfcn",duration_day_other:"{{count}} g\xfcn",duration_month_one:"1 ay",duration_month_other:"{{count}} ay",duration_year_one:"1 y\u0131l",duration_year_other:"{{count}} y\u0131l",duration_yearMonth_one:"1 y\u0131l, 1 ay",duration_yearMonth_other:"{{count}} y\u0131l, {{count2}} ay",tokenEnterAmount:{availableBalance:"Mevcut: <0></0>",selectToken:"Token se\xe7in",fiatPriceUnavailable:"Fiyat mevcut de\u011fil"},celoDollarAmount:"<0></0> Celo Dollar",celoDollarAmount_plural:"<0></0> Celo Dollars"}}),1320,[]);
