0I \u0110A",titleV1_74:"Trao \u0111\u1ed5i s\u1ed1 ti\u1ec1n T\u1ed0I \u0110A",body:"\u0110\u1ea3m b\u1ea3o b\u1ea1n c\xf3 CELO trong v\xed \u0111\u1ec3 thanh to\xe1n ph\xed ga cho c\xe1c giao d\u1ecbch trong t\u01b0\u01a1ng lai",bodyV1_74:"\u0110\u1ea3m b\u1ea3o b\u1ea1n c\xf3 {{tokenSymbol}} trong v\xed \u0111\u1ec3 thanh to\xe1n ph\xed giao d\u1ecbch cho c\xe1c giao d\u1ecbch trong t\u01b0\u01a1ng lai",learnMore:"T\xecm hi\u1ec3u th\xeam"},priceImpactWarning:{title:"Tr\u01b0\u1edbc khi trao \u0111\u1ed5i",body:"Vi\u1ec7c trao \u0111\u1ed5i c\xe1c t\xe0i s\u1ea3n n\xe0y c\xf3 th\u1ec3 d\u1eabn \u0111\u1ebfn b\u1ea5t l\u1ee3i v\u1ec1 t\u1ef7 gi\xe1 quy \u0111\u1ed5i. N\u1ebfu gi\u1ea3m s\u1ed1 ti\u1ec1n, b\u1ea1n c\xf3 th\u1ec3 nh\u1eadn \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c t\u1ef7 gi\xe1 t\u1ed1t h\u01a1n."},noUsdPriceWarning:{title:"Ch\u01b0a c\xf3 gi\xe1 b\u1eb1ng {{localCurrency}}",description:"Ch\xfang t\xf4i ch\u01b0a c\xf3 gi\xe1 b\u1eb1ng {{localCurrency}} cho {{tokenSymbol}}, c\xf3 th\u1ec3 l\xe0 do \u0111\u1ed3ng ti\u1ec1n n\xe0y \xedt \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c giao d\u1ecbch. {{appName}} kh\xf4ng ch\u1ecbu tr\xe1ch nhi\u1ec7m v\u1ec1 b\u1ea5t k\u1ef3 t\u1ed5n th\u1ea5t n\xe0o ph\xe1t sinh n\u1ebfu b\u1ea1n ch\u1ecdn ti\u1ebfp t\u1ee5c giao d\u1ecbch.",ctaConfirm:"T\xf4i \u0111\xe3 hi\u1ec3u.",ctaDismiss:"H\u1ee7y"},missingSwapImpactWarning:{title:"Tr\u01b0\u1edbc khi trao \u0111\u1ed5i",body:"Ch\xfang t\xf4i kh\xf4ng th\u1ec3 \u01b0\u1edbc t\xednh gi\xe1 tr\u1ecb c\u1ee7a giao d\u1ecbch trao \u0111\u1ed5i n\xe0y. {{appName}} s\u1ebd kh\xf4ng ch\u1ecbu tr\xe1ch nhi\u1ec7m n\u1ebfu b\u1ea1n ch\u1ecdn ti\u1ebfp t\u1ee5c."},confirmSwapFailedWarning:{title:"\u0110\xe3 x\u1ea3y ra l\u1ed7i",body:"T\u1ed1c \u0111\u1ed9 m\u1ea1ng ch\u1eadm ho\u1eb7c \u0111\xe3 x\u1ea3y ra l\u1ed7i ch\u01b0a x\xe1c \u0111\u1ecbnh. Vui l\xf2ng th\u1eed l\u1ea1i sau"},estimatedExchangeRate:"T\u1ef7 gi\xe1 \u01b0\u1edbc t\xednh \u2248 <0>0,00</0>",needDecreaseSwapAmountForGas:{title:"S\u1ed1 d\u01b0 {{tokenSymbol}} kh\xf4ng \u0111\u1ee7",description:"B\u1ea1n kh\xf4ng c\xf3 \u0111\u1ee7 {{tokenSymbol}} \u0111\u1ec3 tr\u1ea3 ph\xed gas. B\u1ea1n c\xf3 mu\u1ed1n trao \u0111\u1ed5i m\u1ed9t s\u1ed1 ti\u1ec1n nh\u1ecf h\u01a1n kh\xf4ng?",confirmDecreaseButton:"Trao \u0111\u1ed5i s\u1ed1 ti\u1ec1n nh\u1ecf h\u01a1n"},notEnoughBalanceForGas:{title:"S\u1ed1 d\u01b0 token gas kh\xf4ng \u0111\u1ee7",description:"B\u1ea1n kh\xf4ng c\xf3 \u0111\u1ee7 {{feeCurrencies}} \u0111\u1ec3 tr\u1ea3 ph\xed gas. Vui l\xf2ng n\u1ea1p th\xeam {{feeCurrencies}} v\xe0o v\xed \u0111\u1ec3 ho\xe0n t\u1ea5t giao d\u1ecbch trao \u0111\u1ed5i n\xe0y.",dismissButton:"Lo\u1ea1i b\u1ecf"},transactionDetails:{estimatedNetworkFee:"Ph\xed m\u1ea1ng \u01b0\u1edbc t\xednh",maxNetworkFee:"Ph\xed m\u1ea1ng t\u1ed1i \u0111a",networkFee:"Ph\xed m\u1ea1ng l\u01b0\u1edbi {{networkName}}",networkFeeNoNetwork:"Ph\xed m\u1ea1ng l\u01b0\u1edbi",swapFee:"Ph\xed {{appName}}",swapFeeWaived:"Mi\u1ec5n ph\xed",appFee:"Ph\xed {{appName}}",appFeeValue:"<0></0> <1>(<0></0>)</1>",appFeeValue_withoutPriceUsd:"<0></0>",appFeeValue_free:"Mi\u1ec5n ph\xed",appFeeValue_placeholder:"-",appFeeInfo:"Ph\xed {{appName}}\n\nPh\xed {{appName}} \u1edf m\u1ee9c {{appFeePercentage}}% \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf \u0111\u1ec3 n\xe2ng cao tr\u1ea3i nghi\u1ec7m c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n b\u1eb1ng c\xe1ch \u0111\u1ea3m b\u1ea3o trao \u0111\u1ed5i nhanh ch\xf3ng, \u0111\xe1ng tin c\u1eady v\xe0 an to\xe0n.",appFeeInfo_free:"Ph\xed {{appName}}\n\nGiao d\u1ecbch trao \u0111\u1ed5i n\xe0y \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c mi\u1ec5n ph\xed.",appFeeInfo_placeholder:"Ph\xed {{appName}}\n\nM\u1ee9c ph\xed \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c t\xednh theo b\xe1o gi\xe1 b\u1ea1n nh\u1eadn \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c.",appFeeInfoDismissButton:"\u0110\xe3 hi\u1ec3u",slippagePercentage:"T\u1ef7 l\u1ec7 tr\u01b0\u1ee3t gi\xe1 ch\u1ea5p nh\u1eadn",networkFeeInfo:"B\u1ea1n \u0111ang trao \u0111\u1ed5i tr\xean M\u1ea1ng {{networkName}}.\n\n\u0110\u1ec3 th\u1ef1c hi\u1ec7n giao d\u1ecbch tr\xean M\u1ea1ng {{networkName}}, b\u1ea1n b\u1eaft bu\u1ed9c ph\u1ea3i tr\u1ea3 kho\u1ea3n ph\xed m\u1ea1ng l\u01b0\u1edbi \u01b0\u1edbc t\xednh n\xe0y. Kho\u1ea3n ph\xed n\xe0y s\u1ebd \u0111\u1ea3m b\u1ea3o cho giao d\u1ecbch c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n v\xe0 \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng \u0111\u1ec3 duy tr\xec ho\u1ea1t \u0111\u1ed9ng c\u1ee7a m\u1ea1ng.",networkFeeInfoV1_76:"B\u1ea1n \u0111ang trao \u0111\u1ed5i tr\xean M\u1ea1ng {{networkName}}.\n\n\u0110\u1ec3 th\u1ef1c hi\u1ec7n giao d\u1ecbch tr\xean M\u1ea1ng {{networkName}}, b\u1ea1n b\u1eaft bu\u1ed9c ph\u1ea3i tr\u1ea3 kho\u1ea3n ph\xed m\u1ea1ng n\xe0y. Kho\u1ea3n ph\xed n\xe0y s\u1ebd \u0111\u1ea3m b\u1ea3o cho giao d\u1ecbch c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n v\xe0 \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng \u0111\u1ec3 thanh to\xe1n cho c\xe1c tr\xecnh x\xe1c th\u1ef1c m\u1ea1ng.\n\nDo ph\xed giao d\u1ecbch ch\xednh x\xe1c ph\u1ee5 thu\u1ed9c v\xe0o t\xecnh tr\u1ea1ng m\u1ea1ng, n\xean m\u1ee9c ph\xed \u01b0\u1edbc t\xednh \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c n\xeau t\u1ea1i \u0111\xe2y l\xe0 s\u1ed1 ti\u1ec1n ch\xfang t\xf4i d\u1ef1 \u0111o\xe1n. Kho\u1ea3n ph\xed n\xe0y s\u1ebd kh\xf4ng v\u01b0\u1ee3t qu\xe1 m\u1ee9c ph\xed t\u1ed1i \u0111a.",slippageToleranceInfo:"T\u1ef7 l\u1ec7 tr\u01b0\u1ee3t gi\xe1 ch\u1ea5p nh\u1eadn\n\nVi\u1ec7c trao \u0111\u1ed5i s\u1ebd \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c th\u1ef1c hi\u1ec7n trong ph\u1ea1m vi t\u1ef7 l\u1ec7 tr\u01b0\u1ee3t gi\xe1 ch\u1ea5p nh\u1eadn. N\u1ebfu gi\xe1 thay \u0111\u1ed5i nhi\u1ec1u h\u01a1n t\u1ef7 l\u1ec7 tr\u01b0\u1ee3t gi\xe1 ch\u1ea5p nh\u1eadn, {{appName}} s\u1ebd b\u1ea3o v\u1ec7 b\u1ea1n b\u1eb1ng c\xe1ch ng\u0103n kh\u1edbp l\u1ec7nh giao d\u1ecbch.",slippageToleranceInfoV1_90:"Vi\u1ec7c trao \u0111\u1ed5i s\u1ebd \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c th\u1ef1c hi\u1ec7n trong ph\u1ea1m vi t\u1ef7 l\u1ec7 tr\u01b0\u1ee3t gi\xe1 ch\u1ea5p nh\u1eadn. N\u1ebfu gi\xe1 thay \u0111\u1ed5i nhi\u1ec1u h\u01a1n t\u1ef7 l\u1ec7 tr\u01b0\u1ee3t gi\xe1 ch\u1ea5p nh\u1eadn, {{appName}} s\u1ebd b\u1ea3o v\u1ec7 b\u1ea1n b\u1eb1ng c\xe1ch ng\u0103n kh\u1edbp l\u1ec7nh giao d\u1ecbch.",networkFeeInfoDismissButton:"\u0110\xe3 hi\u1ec3u",exchangeRate:"T\u1ef7 gi\xe1 quy \u0111\u1ed5i",exchangeRateInfo:"T\u1ef7 gi\xe1 quy \u0111\u1ed5i\n\nCh\xfang t\xf4i \u0111\xe3 t\xecm \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c t\u1ef7 gi\xe1 quy \u0111\u1ed5i t\u1ed1t nh\u1ea5t cho b\u1ea1n. Ch\xfang t\xf4i s\u1ebd ho\xe0n th\xe0nh giao d\u1ecbch c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n \u1edf m\u1ee9c gi\xe1 n\u1eb1m trong kho\u1ea3ng {{slippagePercentage}}% so v\u1edbi \u01b0\u1edbc t\xednh ho\u1eb7c s\u1ebd h\u1ee7y giao d\u1ecbch v\xe0 ho\xe0n ti\u1ec1n v\xe0o v\xed c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n.",exchangeRateInfoV1_90:"Ch\xfang t\xf4i \u0111\xe3 t\xecm \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c t\u1ef7 gi\xe1 quy \u0111\u1ed5i t\u1ed1t nh\u1ea5t cho b\u1ea1n. Ch\xfang t\xf4i s\u1ebd ho\xe0n th\xe0nh giao d\u1ecbch c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n \u1edf m\u1ee9c gi\xe1 n\u1eb1m trong kho\u1ea3ng {{slippagePercentage}}% so v\u1edbi \u01b0\u1edbc t\xednh ho\u1eb7c s\u1ebd h\u1ee7y giao d\u1ecbch v\xe0 ho\xe0n ti\u1ec1n v\xe0o v\xed c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n.",exchangeRateInfo_withAppFee:"T\u1ef7 gi\xe1 h\u1ed1i \u0111o\xe1i\n\nCh\xfang t\xf4i \u0111\xe3 t\xecm \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c t\u1ef7 gi\xe1 h\u1ed1i \u0111o\xe1i t\u1ed1t nh\u1ea5t cho b\u1ea1n. Ch\xfang t\xf4i s\u1ebd ho\xe0n th\xe0nh giao d\u1ecbch c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n \u1edf m\u1ee9c gi\xe1 n\u1eb1m trong kho\u1ea3ng {{slippagePercentage}}% so v\u1edbi \u01b0\u1edbc t\xednh ho\u1eb7c s\u1ebd h\u1ee7y giao d\u1ecbch v\xe0 ho\xe0n ti\u1ec1n v\xe0o v\xed c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n.\n\nT\u1ef7 gi\xe1 \u01b0\u1edbc t\xednh bao g\u1ed3m ph\xed {{appName}} l\xe0 {{appFeePercentage}}%.",exchangeRateInfoDismissButton:"\u0110\xe3 hi\u1ec3u",estimatedValue:"Gi\xe1 tr\u1ecb \u01b0\u1edbc t\xednh",estimatedTransactionTime:"Th\u1eddi gian giao d\u1ecbch \u01b0\u1edbc t\xednh",estimatedTransactionTimeInMinutes:"\u2248 {{minutes}} ph\xfat",estimatedTransactionTimeInfo:"Th\u1eddi gian ho\xe0n th\xe0nh giao d\u1ecbch s\u1ebd do nh\xe0 cung c\u1ea5p x\xe1c \u0111\u1ecbnh.\n\nN\u1ebfu b\u1ea1n \u0111ang trao \u0111\u1ed5i gi\u1eefa c\xe1c chu\u1ed7i kh\xe1c nhau, giao d\u1ecbch \u0111\xf3 c\xf3 th\u1ec3 m\u1ea5t nhi\u1ec1u th\u1eddi gian h\u01a1n m\u1ed9t ch\xfat \u0111\u1ec3 ho\xe0n th\xe0nh.",infoDismissButton:"\u0110\xe3 hi\u1ec3u",fees:"Ph\xed",feesCalculationError:"Kh\xf4ng th\u1ec3 t\xednh ph\xed",estimatedCrossChainFee:"Ph\xed trao \u0111\u1ed5i chu\u1ed7i ch\xe9o \u01b0\u1edbc t\xednh",maxCrossChainFee:"Ph\xed trao \u0111\u1ed5i chu\u1ed7i ch\xe9o t\u1ed1i \u0111a",feesBreakdown:"Chi ti\u1ebft",feeAmount:"\u2248 {{localCurrencySymbol}}{{feeAmountInLocalCurrency}} ({{tokenAmount}} {{tokenSymbol}})",feeAmount_noFiatPrice:"{{tokenAmount}} {{tokenSymbol}}",feesMoreInfoLabel:"Th\xf4ng tin b\u1ed5 sung",feesInfo_sameChain:"Ph\xed m\u1ea1ng l\xe0 kho\u1ea3n ph\xed b\u1eaft bu\u1ed9c \u0111\u1ec3 m\u1ea1ng c\xf3 th\u1ec3 x\u1eed l\xfd giao d\u1ecbch.",feesInfo_crossChain:"Ph\xed m\u1ea1ng l\xe0 kho\u1ea3n ph\xed b\u1eaft bu\u1ed9c \u0111\u1ec3 m\u1ea1ng c\xf3 th\u1ec3 x\u1eed l\xfd giao d\u1ecbch. Nh\xe0 cung c\u1ea5p chu\u1ed7i ch\xe9o s\u1ebd thu ph\xed trao \u0111\u1ed5i chu\u1ed7i ch\xe9o.",feesInfo_sameChainWithAppFee:"Ph\xed m\u1ea1ng l\xe0 kho\u1ea3n ph\xed b\u1eaft bu\u1ed9c \u0111\u1ec3 m\u1ea1ng c\xf3 th\u1ec3 x\u1eed l\xfd giao d\u1ecbch. Ch\xfang t\xf4i s\u1ebd thu ph\xed {{appName}} l\xe0 {{appFeePercentage}}% khi b\u1ea1n s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m c\u1ee7a ch\xfang t\xf4i.",feesInfo_crossChainWithAppFee:"Ph\xed m\u1ea1ng l\xe0 kho\u1ea3n ph\xed b\u1eaft bu\u1ed9c \u0111\u1ec3 m\u1ea1ng c\xf3 th\u1ec3 x\u1eed l\xfd giao d\u1ecbch. Nh\xe0 cung c\u1ea5p chu\u1ed7i ch\xe9o s\u1ebd thu ph\xed trao \u0111\u1ed5i chu\u1ed7i ch\xe9o. Ch\xfang t\xf4i s\u1ebd thu ph\xed {{appName}} l\xe0 {{appFeePercentage}}% khi b\u1ea1n s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m c\u1ee7a ch\xfang t\xf4i."},fundYourWalletBottomSheet:{title:"N\u1ea1p ti\u1ec1n v\xe0o v\xed c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n",description:"\u0110\u1ec3 trao \u0111\u1ed5i token, b\