e0y se\u0303 ti\u1ebfp t\u1ee5c sinh l\u01a1\u0300i d\u1ef1a tr\xean s\u1ed1 ti\xea\u0300n t\u0103ng l\xean. ",tvlTitle:"T\u1ed5ng gi\xe1 tr\u1ecb b\u1ecb kh\xf3a (TVL)",tvlDescription:"TVL l\xe0 t\u1ed5ng l\u01b0\u1ee3ng t\xe0i s\u1ea3n \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c n\u1ea1p v\xe0o m\u1ed9t b\u1ec3 thanh kho\u1ea3n v\xe0 c\xf3 th\u1ec3 \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c d\xf9ng \u0111\u1ec3 cho bi\u1ebft \u0111\u1ed9 tin c\u1eady v\xe0 ti\u1ec7n \xedch c\u1ee7a b\u1ec3 \u0111\xf3. Th\xf4ng th\u01b0\u1eddng, m\u1ed9t TVL cao h\u01a1n t\u01b0\u01a1ng \u1ee9ng v\u1edbi m\u1ee9c r\u1ee7i ro th\u1ea5p h\u01a1n; tuy nhi\xean, kh\xf4ng c\xf3 b\u1ec3 n\xe0o ho\xe0n to\xe0n kh\xf4ng r\u1ee7i ro.",ageTitle:"Th\u1eddi gian ho\u1ea1t \u0111\u1ed9ng c\u1ee7a b\u1ec3",ageDescription:"C\xe1c b\u1ec3 thanh kho\u1ea3n c\u0169 h\u01a1n c\xf3 th\u1ec3 cho th\u1ea5y m\u1ed9t th\xe0nh t\xedch ho\u1ea1t \u0111\u1ed9ng \u1ed5n \u0111\u1ecbnh v\xe0 l\u1ecbch s\u1eed x\xe2y d\u1ef1ng ni\u1ec1m tin trong c\u1ed9ng \u0111\u1ed3ng. V\xec l\xfd do n\xe0y, m\u1ed9t s\u1ed1 ng\u01b0\u1eddi c\xf3 th\u1ec3 coi nh\u1eefng b\u1ec3 n\xe0y an to\xe0n h\u01a1n.\n\nKh\xf4ng c\xf3 c\xe1ch n\xe0o to\xe0n v\u1eb9n trong vi\u1ec7c x\xe1c \u0111\u1ecbnh r\u1ee7i ro; v\xec v\u1eady, h\xe3y s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng th\xf4ng tin n\xe0y v\xe0o nghi\xean c\u1ee9u t\u1ed5ng th\u1ec3 c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n \u0111\u1ec3 \u0111\u01b0a ra quy\u1ebft \u0111\u1ecbnh t\u1ed1t nh\u1ea5t cho b\u1ea3n th\xe2n.",yieldRateTitle:"M\u1ee9c sinh l\u1ee3i",yieldRateDescription:"Trong khi h\u1ea7u h\u1ebft c\xe1c b\u1ec3 cung c\u1ea5p thu nh\u1eadp d\u01b0\u1edbi d\u1ea1ng token c\u1ee7a b\u1ec3 thanh kho\u1ea3n, m\u1ed9t s\u1ed1 b\u1ec3 l\u1ea1i cung c\u1ea5p (c\xe1c) token kh\xe1c d\u01b0\u1edbi d\u1ea1ng ti\u1ec1n th\u01b0\u1edfng ho\u1eb7c \u01b0u \u0111\xe3i b\u1ed5 sung.\n\nV\xec {{appName}} t\u1ed5ng h\u1ee3p c\xe1c b\u1ec3 t\u1eeb nhi\u1ec1u giao th\u1ee9c, ch\xfang t\xf4i \u0111\xe3 k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p t\u1ea5t c\u1ea3 c\xe1c t\u1ef7 l\u1ec7 thu nh\u1eadp v\xe0 ti\u1ec1n th\u01b0\u1edfng th\xe0nh m\u1ed9t m\u1ee9c sinh l\u1ee3i chung duy nh\u1ea5t \u0111\u1ec3 d\u1ec5 d\xe0ng \u0111\xe1nh gi\xe1 ti\u1ec1m n\u0103ng thu nh\u1eadp c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n. Con s\u1ed1 n\xe0y ch\u1ec9 l\xe0 \u01b0\u1edbc t\xednh v\xec gi\xe1 tr\u1ecb thu nh\u1eadp v\xe0 ti\u1ec1n th\u01b0\u1edfng thay \u0111\u1ed5i li\xean t\u1ee5c.\n\n\u0110\u1ec3 t\xecm hi\u1ec3u th\xeam c\xe1c ph\xe2n t\xedch chi ti\u1ebft v\u1ec1 thu nh\u1eadp, b\u1ea1n c\xf3 th\u1ec3 truy c\u1eadp <0>{{providerName}}</0>.",dailyYieldRateTitle:"M\u1ee9c sinh l\u1ee3i h\u1eb1ng ng\xe0y",dailyYieldRateDescription:"M\u1ee9c sinh l\u1ee3i h\u1eb1ng ng\xe0y m\xe0 b\u1ea1n th\u1ea5y l\xe0 d\u1eef li\u1ec7u do {{providerName}} cung c\u1ea5p.",dailyYieldRateLink:"Xem th\xeam th\xf4ng tin \u0111\u1ea7y \u0111\u1ee7 v\u1ec1 m\u1ee9c sinh l\u1ee3i c\u1ee7a {{providerName}}",safetyScoreTitle:"\u0110i\u1ec3m an to\xe0n",safetyScoreDescription:"\u0110i\u1ec3m an to\xe0n ph\xe2n t\xe1ch \u0111\u1ed9 an to\xe0n c\u1ee7a t\xe0i s\u1ea3n c\u01a1 s\u1edf trong kho th\xe0nh m\u1ed9t v\xe0i y\u1ebfu t\u1ed1 ch\xednh. \u0110i\u1ec3m an to\xe0n gi\xfap b\u1ea1n ch\xfa \xfd \u0111\u1ebfn c\xe1c r\u1ee7i ro c\u1ea7n c\xe2n nh\u1eafc tr\u01b0\u1edbc khi \u0111\u1ea7u t\u01b0, \u0111\u1ed3ng th\u1eddi th\xf4ng b\xe1o c\xe1c chi ti\u1ebft c\u01a1 b\u1ea3n m\xe0 b\u1ea1n c\xf3 th\u1ec3 kh\xf4ng t\u1ef1 \u0111\xe1nh gi\xe1 \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c.\nM\u1eb7c d\xf9 l\u1ec7nh giao d\u1ecbch \u0111\u1ea7y \u0111\u1ee7 s\u1ebd lu\xf4n ph\u1ee9c t\u1ea1p h\u01a1n, nh\u01b0ng \u0110i\u1ec3m an to\xe0n v\u1eabn c\xf3 th\u1ec3 \u0111\u01a1n gi\u1ea3n h\xf3a c\xe1c r\u1ee7i ro v\xe0 an to\xe0n ch\xednh c\u1ea7n c\xe2n nh\u1eafc v\xe0 kh\u1edfi \u0111\u1ed9ng qu\xe1 tr\xecnh t\u1ef1 th\u1ea9m \u0111\u1ecbnh c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n. \u0110\u1ed9i ng\u0169 c\u1ee7a ch\xfang t\xf4i c\u1ea9n th\u1eadn xem x\xe9t t\u1eebng y\u1ebfu t\u1ed1 tr\u01b0\u1edbc khi \xe1p d\u1ee5ng m\u1ed9t kho ti\u1ec1n v\xe0 lu\xf4n theo d\xf5i t\u1eebng t\xe0i s\u1ea3n, chu\u1ed7i v\xe0 giao th\u1ee9c m\xe0 {{providerName}} \u0111\xe3 t\xedch h\u1ee3p.",safetyScoreRateLink:"Xem th\xf4ng tin \u0111\u1ea7y \u0111\u1ee7 v\u1ec1 \u0111i\u1ec3m an to\xe0n c\u1ee7a {{providerName}}"},viewMoreDetails:"Xem th\xeam th\xf4ng tin",viewLessDetails:"\u1ea8n b\u1edbt th\xf4ng tin"},beforeDepositBottomSheet:{youNeedTitle:"B\u1ea1n c\u1ea7n {{tokenSymbol}} tr\xean {{tokenNetwork}} \u0111\u1ec3 n\u1ea1p",crossChainAlternativeDescription:"N\u1ebfu b\u1ea1n kh\xf4ng mu\u1ed1n s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng token tr\xean {{tokenNetwork}}, h\xe3y ch\u1ecdn m\u1ed9t l\u1ef1a ch\u1ecdn b\xean d\u01b0\u1edbi. B\u1ea1n s\u1ebd ph\u1ea3i quay l\u1ea1i \u0111\u1ec3 ho\xe0n t\u1ea5t giao d\u1ecbch n\u1ea1p v\xe0o b\u1ec3 sau \u0111\xf3.",beforeYouCanDepositTitle:"Tr\u01b0\u1edbc khi b\u1ea1n c\xf3 th\u1ec3 n\u1ea1p...",beforeYouCanDepositDescription:"B\u1ea1n s\u1ebd c\u1ea7n th\xeam m\u1ed9t trong c\xe1c token b\u1ec3. Sau khi th\xeam, b\u1ea1n ph\u1ea3i quay l\u1ea1i \u0111\u1ec3 ho\xe0n t\u1ea5t giao d\u1ecbch n\u1ea1p v\xe0o b\u1ec3.",action:{swapAndDeposit:"Trao \u0111\u1ed5i v\xe0 n\u1ea1p",swapAndDepositDescription:"Ch\u1ecdn token b\u1ea5t k\u1ef3 tr\xean {{tokenNetwork}}. Ch\xfang t\xf4i s\u1ebd trao \u0111\u1ed5i v\xe0 n\u1ea1p \u0111\u1ed3ng th\u1eddi token \u0111\xf3 cho b\u1ea1n.",crossChainSwap:"Trao \u0111\u1ed5i chu\u1ed7i ch\xe9o",crossChainSwapDescription:"Trao \u0111\u1ed5i token tr\xean m\u1ed9t m\u1ea1ng kh\xe1c \u0111\u1ec3 l\u1ea5y {{tokenSymbol}}",swap:"Trao \u0111\u1ed5i",swapDescription:"Trao \u0111\u1ed5i th\xe0nh {{tokenSymbol}} tr\xean {{tokenNetwork}} t\u1eeb m\u1ed9t token kh\xe1c trong v\xed c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n",add:"Mua",addDescription:"Mua {{tokenSymbol}} tr\xean {{tokenNetwork}} qua m\u1ed9t trong nh\u1eefng nh\xe0 cung c\u1ea5p uy t\xedn c\u1ee7a ch\xfang t\xf4i",transfer:"Chuy\u1ec3n ti\u1ec1n",transferDescription:"S\u1eed d\u1ee5ng b\u1ea5t k\u1ef3 v\xed ho\u1eb7c s\xe0n giao d\u1ecbch n\xe0o t\u01b0\u01a1ng th\xedch 